n class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2276040/extras/2e17c41ff3194d8af9f31813a417a2c2.webp?t=1754584137\" /></span>  <br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Pixelated 2D sprites in 3D environments<br></li><li>Explore an island full of hidden secrets<br></li><li>Help your animal friends!<br></li><li>Solve puzzles to unlock new areas<br></li><li>Play some mini-games<br></li><li>Dance with everyone!<br></li><li>Dedicated RIBBIT button!<br></li><li>Hop everywhere!<br></li><li>Take selfies!<br></li><li>Original soundtrack<br></li><li>4th-wall breaking<br></li><li>Lots of humor!</li></ul>",
